very VLM config&lt;/b&gt; (γ = 0 everywhere). A run becomes the baseline if its validation HM at γ = 0 beats the current baseline by &amp;gt; 2 points on the same validation images (1-split runs and ensembles: split 42). Runs are checked in version order. Promotion path: v4.2 → v11.3." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="2000" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l0" value="Baseline / promoted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#2e7d32;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3016" width="210" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l1" value="Rejected (Δ ≤ +2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="3016" width="210" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l2" value="No validation (zero-shot, early v4)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="3016" width="210" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l3" value="Excluded (bias gate = calibration)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="3016" width="210" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l9" value="Solid grey: built-on (config lineage). Dashed blue: uses another run as image features (GAN) or ensemble member. Green: the promotion path. Val γ0 is the saved model (epoch as trained) scored with γ = 0; at γ = 0, HM mostly reflects seen bias, so compare with test AUSUC (recognition)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3066" width="1400" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
